Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why do manhole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.79,0:00:02.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,covers sometimes blast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:02.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:04.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Under many streets,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:05.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,power cables run
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:06.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,through\Nunderground vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:07.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,In winter, salty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:09.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,meltwater drips down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:10.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,onto old cables.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:11.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,The salt eats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the insulation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:13.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,until electricity arcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:14.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,The burning insulation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:15.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,gives off flammable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,gas that fills
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:17.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,One spark, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:19.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,the gas explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:20.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,That can launch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:21.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,a cast iron
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:21.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,cover weighing up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:22.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,to three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:23.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,hundred pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,So New York's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:25.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,utility is swapping
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:25.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,in covers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:26.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,with vents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gas escapes through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,the holes instead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:28.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,of building up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:29.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Others are latched:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:30.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,they pop up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:31.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,a few inches,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:32.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,vent, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:33.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,drop back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:33.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.79,0:00:34.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,city manhole covers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:35.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,are full
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.17,0:00:35.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,of holes.
